{"title":"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/6/206f54d0d3ae11704519113ce197219e714e61e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 2 + 3 + 4 + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"136\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/d/c3df60a8a08e3d877551a6b14b7bc145fffdb8d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 2 + 3 + 4 + 5 = 3 + 3 + 4 + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"263\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/a/a1a4f7ba1b2ad682001c6adfacf874da3749fae1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=6 + 4 + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/0/810d27597609842261246ca5a47736fbb7513448.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=10 + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/7/b47e06121bc911746c217101232f8104303521c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"50\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is a positive integer, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/f/9ef7f51bbd8b88672ccbd6f9d0788fccc51a9bab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 2 + 3 + ... + (n - 1) + n = \\frac{n(n + 1)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"318\" height=\"40\" />. In <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/6/206f54d0d3ae11704519113ce197219e714e61e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 2 + 3 + 4 + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"136\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/3/ec37f4048b4f92c2227c9bfe79fcb7d52ab99c9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 5$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />. This means that:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/5/435a43c2c21c74b8794463aff047ab7fbfe687af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 2 + 3 + 4 + 5 = \\frac{5(5 + 1)}{2} = \\frac{5 \\times 6}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"297\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/3/f332a451de11a1d287952f445840b35a323c0a51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{30}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"43\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/7/b47e06121bc911746c217101232f8104303521c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"50\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align: